From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] JM10: dump pstore/ramoops region to eMMC before rockusb

The JM10 board has no TTL debug UART exposed, so a kernel that hangs
before the console is up leaves no trace. The RK3588 keeps a
ramoops/pstore region at 0x110000..0x1f0000 (see the kernel
rk3588-linux.dtsi ramoops node); U-Boot itself also mirrors its console
output there when CONFIG_PSTORE is set.

When the board enters download mode (hold volume-up during power-on or
warm reset, or `reboot loader` from Linux), dump that RAM region into
the unused 4M..8M gap of the Armbian GPT layout (LBA 0x2000,
0x700 sectors = 896 KiB). The log can then be pulled from a host with:

  sudo rkdeveloptool rl 0x2000 0x700 jm10-crashlog.bin
  strings jm10-crashlog.bin

Also give U-Boot's own pstore capture a fallback address so SPL/U-Boot
logs land in RAM even when the preloader passes no ATAG_PSTORE tag.

Signed-off-by: John Doe <john.doe@somewhere.on.planet>
---
 board/rockchip/evb_rk3588/evb_rk3588.c | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 configs/rk3588_defconfig               |  2 ++
 2 files changed, 20 insertions(+)

diff --git a/board/rockchip/evb_rk3588/evb_rk3588.c b/board/rockchip/evb_rk3588/evb_rk3588.c
index 1a2b3c4d5e6..0f1e2d3c4b5 100644
--- a/board/rockchip/evb_rk3588/evb_rk3588.c
+++ b/board/rockchip/evb_rk3588/evb_rk3588.c
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 #include <common.h>
 #include <dwc3-uboot.h>
 #include <usb.h>
+#include <command.h>
 #include <linux/usb/phy-rockchip-usbdp.h>
 #include <asm/io.h>
 #include <rockusb.h>
@@ -155,3 +156,24 @@ int do_mac(cmd_tbl_t *cmdtp, int flag, int argc, char * const argv[])
 }

 #endif
+
+/*
+ * JM10 debug: dump the ramoops/pstore region (0x110000..0x1f0000) to the
+ * unused 4M..8M gap of the Armbian GPT before entering rockusb, so the
+ * last crash log can be recovered from a host with:
+ *   rkdeveloptool rl 0x2000 0x700 jm10-crashlog.bin
+ */
+void do_board_download(void)
+{
+	printf("JM10: dump pstore 0x110000..0x1f0000 to eMMC LBA 0x2000\n");
+
+	if (run_command("mmc dev 0", 0)) {
+		printf("JM10: mmc dev 0 failed, skip crashlog dump\n");
+		return;
+	}
+
+	if (run_command("mmc write 0x110000 0x2000 0x700", 0))
+		printf("JM10: crashlog dump failed\n");
+	else
+		printf("JM10: crashlog dumped, pull it with: rkdeveloptool rl 0x2000 0x700\n");
+}
diff --git a/configs/rk3588_defconfig b/configs/rk3588_defconfig
index c17e58612ce..d34df00d123 100644
--- a/configs/rk3588_defconfig
+++ b/configs/rk3588_defconfig
@@ -235,2 +235,5 @@ CONFIG_OPTEE_CLIENT=y
 CONFIG_OPTEE_V2=y
 CONFIG_OPTEE_ALWAYS_USE_SECURITY_PARTITION=n
+
+CONFIG_PERSISTENT_RAM_ADDR=0x110000
+CONFIG_PERSISTENT_RAM_SIZE=0xe0000
--
2.34.1

